;default:&#10;}&#10;select {&#10;case &lt;-ctx.Done():&#10;    return&#10;case v := &lt;-ch:&#10;    process(v)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 错误假设：ctx.Done 会优先于 ch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 不保证优先！多 case 就绪时随机选</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ch:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 如需优先检查取消，用嵌套 select 或先检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ch:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>select 的核心是「将一个 G 同时注册到多个 channel 的等待队列」</li>\n<li>多 case 就绪时随机选择，不可假设顺序或优先级</li>\n<li>nil channel case 永远不触发——用于动态开关</li>\n<li>case 数量线性影响性能，超过 8 个应考虑重构</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"gmp-scheduler\">GMP 调度模型</a>——select 的 gopark/goready 是调度器状态机的具体调用路径</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../go-service-engineering/running-in-production/graceful-shutdown\">Go 服务工程 · 优雅关停</a>——优雅关停的核心就是用 select 监听 os.Signal channel 与 context.Done</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Select 多路复用","id":"select-多路复用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"select 的四种使用模式","id":"select-的四种使用模式"},{"level":3,"text":"模式一：超时控制","id":"模式一-超时控制"},{"level":3,"text":"模式二：非阻塞尝试","id":"模式二-非阻塞尝试"},{"level":3,"text":"模式三：多源合并","id":"模式三-多源合并"},{"level":3,"text":"模式四：动态启用/禁用分支","id":"模式四-动态启用-禁用分支"},{"level":2,"text":"性能特征","id":"性能特征"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱","id":"常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Channel 语义与内部结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/foundations/channel-internals"},"next":{"title":"Pipeline 流水线模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/patterns/pipeline"}}